Package: BCIntrog
Type: Package
Title: Identify Donor-Derived Introgression Segments in Backcross Populations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pengfei", "Wang", email = "wangpf0608@126.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R package for identifying donor-parent-derived genomic segments in
    plant backcross populations from whole-genome resequencing VCF data. It
    filters parental informative markers, runs a three-state hidden Markov model
    (donor homozygous, recurrent homozygous, and heterozygous), detects
    introgressed segments, summarizes donor and recurrent genome proportions,
    and generates genome-wide visualizations.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    vcfR,
    dplyr,
    tibble,
    rlang,
    ggplot2,
    cowplot
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    ggrastr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
